<title>GERMANY: German builders plan news conference on wages.</title>
<headline>German builders plan news conference on wages.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Construction industry employers and union IG Bau will hold a press conference on Friday at 0800 GMT on talks to avert a strike, a spokesman for the ZDB building employers union said.</p>
<p>The spokesman declined to comment on progress in the talks which cover wages and sick-pay.</p>
<p>-- Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
